---
---

<section id="faq" class="w-full py-16 lg:py-28 bg-surfaceLight font-gothic" aria-label="Preguntas frecuentes" data-analytics-section-view>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="mb-10 lg:mb-16 opacity-0" data-animate>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl uppercase text-primary text-center">Preguntas frecuentes</h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-left opacity-0" data-animate style="animation-delay: 100ms">
      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Necesito experiencia previa?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">No. El curso es de nivel inicial y comienza desde los fundamentos del oficio.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿El curso incluye herramientas?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Durante las clases presenciales se utilizan herramientas e insumos profesionales de la escuela.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Tengo que llevar cabeza de práctica?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Sí. A partir del módulo 2 vas a necesitar una cabeza de práctica para corte. Podés consultar opciones para adquirirla.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Tengo que llevar modelo?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Sí. En algunas clases prácticas el profesor puede pedirte que lleves modelo. Puede ser un familiar, amigo o conocido. Los modelos no son proporcionados obligatoriamente por la escuela.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿El curso incluye certificado?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Sí. El certificado está incluido al aprobar el examen final.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Dónde se cursa?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">En Escuela Stylo’s, en Ituzaingó.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Las inscripciones están abiertas?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">No por el momento. Podés dejar tus datos en el formulario y te vamos a avisar por mail cuando abramos una nueva camada.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item group bg-white border border-accentMuted rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/50">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center justify-between select-none">
          <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-primary pr-4">¿Cómo me entero cuando abran nuevas inscripciones?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary/60 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-6 lg:pt-2 lg:pb-8">
          <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-primary/80 leading-relaxed">Completando el formulario de interesados. Cuando haya nueva fecha de inscripción, te vamos a contactar por mail.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
